{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Teruteru Bouze named &quot;Terunyan&quot; loves The Sun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As usual, Terunyan is wandering around and collecting elementals as a hobby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terunyan to Amanoiwato is a rhythm game in which Terunyan straight ahead and collects elementals.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elementals can be efficiently gathered by collecting them in rhythm to the music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can collect elementals that come to the judgment area near Terunyan. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, failure to collect elementals will reduce Terunyan's motivation and increase the density of the fog in the landscape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, if Terunyan's motivation reaches zero, Terunyan will return home and the game will be over. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good news for those who want to reduce the fog and enjoy the cute appearance of Terunyan. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Ternyan collects elementals, it accumulates energy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You can use that energy to activate skills and blow away the fog that occurs when you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the trial version, you can only play the story and online mode 01.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525410?t=1740039925","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740039925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525410/b819656c0288e987adbfc240da3b3352d2497e7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740039925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525410/b819656c0288e987adbfc240da3b3352d2497e7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740039925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Teruteru Bouze named &quot;Terunyan&quot; loves The Sun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As usual, Terunyan is wandering around and collecting elementals as a hobby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terunyan to Amanoiwato is a rhythm game in which Terunyan straight ahead and collects elementals.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elementals can be efficiently gathered by collecting them in rhythm to the music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can collect elementals that come to the judgment area near Terunyan. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, failure to collect elementals will reduce Terunyan's motivation and increase the density of the fog in the landscape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, if Terunyan's motivation reaches zero, Terunyan will return home and the game will be over. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good news for those who want to reduce the fog and enjoy the cute appearance of Terunyan. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Ternyan collects elementals, it accumulates energy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You can use that energy to activate skills and blow away the fog that occurs when you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the trial version, you can only play the story and online mode 01.</p>","developers":["Terunyan"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2846000","name":"Terunyan to Amanoiwato"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525410/header.jpg?t=1740039925","is_fr